</style><h2>BlinkyBot 0.1.3</h2><ul><li><strong>Compose starts.</strong> The packaged app was missing <code>@swc/helpers</code> on the path Next uses, so the window stayed on &quot;Compose is not open yet.&quot; The standalone server now links the packages Next loads at startup.</li><li><strong>A Mac open check gates the build.</strong> CI starts the built BlinkyBot.app and requires <code>http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/version</code> to answer. A missing module fails the job before a release is published.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-bot/releases/tag/v0.1.3">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
